// EVOPIVC - [G]/[H] = the pivot columns of the original matrix ʟMXO (M x max(1,U)).
// Str5 lists the column numbers.  Clobbers: I J K
{M,max(1,U)}→dim([G]):{M,max(1,U)}→dim([H])
Fill(0,[G]):Fill(1,[H])
0→K
"COLUMNS"→Str5
For(J,1,N)
If ʟMXPR(J):Then
K+1→K
Str5+" "+toString(J)→Str5
For(I,1,M)
ʟMXO(2+2((I-1)N+J))→[G](I,K):ʟMXO(3+2((I-1)N+J))→[H](I,K)
End
End
End
Str5+" OF THE MATRIX"→Str5
